      "class": "Frame",
      "globalid": "rt",
      "alias": "root",
      "size": "{1,0},{1,0}",
      "background_color": "#0b0e13",
      "children": [
        {
          "class": "TextLabel",
          "globalid": "tt",
          "alias": "title",
          "position": "{0,16},{0,16}",
          "size": "{1,-32},{0,28}",
          "text": "CWBridge Client",
          "font": "BuilderSansBold",
          "font_size": "18",
          "font_color": "#eef1f7",
          "background_transparency": "1",
          "align_x": "Left"
        },
        {
          "class": "TextLabel",
          "globalid": "st",
          "alias": "hint",
          "position": "{0,16},{0,52}",
          "size": "{1,-32},{0,90}",
          "text": "1) Import decoder (e/d) on this page.\n2) Set var 1 = your SERVER page URL (site.rbx/bridge).\n3) Use the functions below.\n\nResult always lands in var 4 → 0.body or 1.err",
          "font": "BuilderSans",
          "font_size": "13",
          "font_color": "#8b93a7",
          "background_transparency": "1",
          "align_x": "Left",
          "wrap": "true"
        },
        {
          "class": "TextLabel",
          "globalid": "ex",
          "alias": "example",
          "position": "{0,16},{0,150}",
          "size": "{1,-32},{0,110}",
          "text": "Example usage:\nSet 30 = load\nSet 31 = mykey\nSet 32 = app.rbx\nRun function (call)  →  result in {4}\n\nor just Run function (load) after setting 31 + 32",
          "font": "BuilderSans",
          "font_size": "13",
          "font_color": "#a8b0c4",
          "background_transparency": "1",
          "align_x": "Left",
          "wrap": "true"
